==Other Appearances==
==={{SSBU|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
A pair of Hylian Trousers appear as part of Link's standard costume in {{SSBU}}. They also appear as part of the Champion's Outfit, a [[Mii Outfit]] for [[Mii Swordfighter]]s, paired with the [[Champion's Wig]] which is accessible to any [[Mii Fighter]].
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
Hylian Trousers are unlocked after completing the "[[Freeing Korok Forest]]" [[Scenario]].

